# The Node version pnpm checks `engines` against. A newer pnpm (Hiraiship's build image has pnpm 12) runs the
# packageManager version, pnpm 8.10.0, as its standalone binary, which reports the Node it bundles (18.5.0) instead of
# the one installed: optional native packages that need Node >= 20.19 (rolldown's and Tailwind's Linux bindings) are
# then skipped, and `rasengan build` fails with "Cannot find native binding". Drop this line when moving to pnpm 10+.
node-version=22.12.0
